# Legal Reference Library

Reference only when necessary.

Not every email requires legal citations.

---

# Debt Reconciliation

When debt figures cannot be verified:

Request:

- contract
- statement
- transaction records
- reconciliation documents

Focus on verification.

Do not immediately argue legal validity.

---

# Payment Position

A user may request reconciliation before confirming debt figures.

Keep attention on transparency and verification.

---

# Contract and Credit Issues

Use legal arguments only when:

- establishing position
- responding to legal claims
- preparing escalation

Always keep citations minimal.

---

# Core Principles

Contract basis.

Debt verification.

Transparency.

Data accuracy.

Good faith communication.
